put: EmbeddingInputItem[];","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L3100","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:3100"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The items to embed — one vector per item"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"logger","children":[{"type":"text","value":"logger"}]},{"type":"code","value":"logger: InternalLogger;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L3113","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:3113"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Internal logger threaded from the embed() entry point. Adapters must\ncall logger.request() before the SDK call and logger.errors() in catch\nblocks."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"model","children":[{"type":"text","value":"model"}]},{"type":"code","value":"model: string;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L3098","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:3098"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The model to use for embedding generation"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"modeloptions","children":[{"type":"text","value":"modelOptions?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional modelOptions?: TProviderOptions;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L3107","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:3107"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Model-specific options for embedding generation"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tprovideroptions","text":"TProviderOptions","level":3},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"dimensions","text":"dimensions?","level":3},{"id":"input","text":"input","level":3},{"id":"logger","text":"logger","level":3},{"id":"model","text":"model","level":3},{"id":"modeloptions","text":"modelOptions?","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:3096](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L3096)\n\nOptions for embedding generation, as received by adapters. The `embed()`\nentry point normalizes a single input item to an array before calling the\nadapter, so `input` is always an array here.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TProviderOptions\n\n`TProviderOptions` *extends* `object` = `object`\n\n## Properties\n\n### dimensions?\n\n```ts\noptional dimensions?: number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:3105](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L3105)\n\nRequested output dimensionality. Adapters for models with fixed\ndimensions throw a clear runtime error when this is set.\n\n***\n\n### input\n\n```ts\ninput: EmbeddingInputItem[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:3100](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L3100)\n\nThe items to embed — one vector per item\n\n***\n\n### logger\n\n```ts\nlogger: InternalLogger;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:3113](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L3113)\n\nInternal logger threaded from the embed() entry point. Adapters must\ncall logger.request() before the SDK call and logger.errors() in catch\nblocks.\n\n***\n\n### model\n\n```ts\nmodel: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:3098](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L3098)\n\nThe model to use for embedding generation\n\n***\n\n### modelOptions?\n\n```ts\noptional modelOptions?: TProviderOptions;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:3107](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L3107)\n\nModel-specific options for embedding generation\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: EmbeddingOptions\ntitle: EmbeddingOptions\n---\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:3096](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L3096)\n\nOptions for embedding generation, as received by adapters. The `embed()`\nentry point normalizes a single input item to an array before calling the\nadapter, so `input` is always an array here.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TProviderOptions\n\n`TProviderOptions` *extends* `object` = `object`\n\n## Properties\n\n### dimensions?\n\n```ts\noptional dimensions?: number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:3105](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L3105)\n\nRequested output dimensionality. Adapters for models with fixed\ndimensions throw a clear runtime error when this is set.\n\n***\n\n### input\n\n```ts\ninput: EmbeddingInputItem[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:3100](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L3100)\n\nThe items to embed — one vector per item\n\n***\n\n### logger\n\n```ts\nlogger: InternalLogger;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:3113](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L3113)\n\nInternal logger threaded from the embed() entry point. Adapters must\ncall logger.request() before the SDK call and logger.errors() in catch\nblocks.\n\n***\n\n### model\n\n```ts\nmodel: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:3098](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L3098)\n\nThe model to use for embedding generation\n\n***\n\n### modelOptions?\n\n```ts\noptional modelOptions?: TProviderOptions;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:3107](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L3107)\n\nModel-specific options for embedding generation\n"}
